{"id":"ce29986d-0883-4373-b454-1a170b53e328","createdAt":"2026-10-27T05:11:57.164Z","batchId":"pricing_step-3-7-flash-gateway_high","approach":"html","modelId":"step-3.7-flash-gateway","settings":{"effort":"high"},"presetId":"pricing","prompt":"A pricing page with three plans (Free, Pro, Team), their features and a call to action for each.","system":"Return only the body content of an HTML page: no doctype, <html>, <head> or <body> tags, no markdown, no code fences, no prose. The page shell below is already loaded, so build with its classes and chart helper. Inline <script> is allowed for interactivity (tabs, toggles, filters); no external requests. Add a small <style> block only for what the classes cannot express, or when the request asks for a different look, colours, fonts or layout: then follow the request.\nPAGE SHELL (already loaded; do not restate it):\n- A stylesheet with these classes. Use them instead of writing CSS:\n  layout: page (centered column), stack, row, between, center, gap-sm, gap-lg, grid + cols-2|cols-3|cols-4 (responsive)\n  surfaces: card, card-title, card-desc, alert, alert-destructive, hr\n  text: h1-h4 (styled), lead, muted, small, up, down (trend colours)\n  controls: btn, btn-secondary|btn-outline|btn-ghost|btn-destructive, btn-sm|btn-lg, btn-block; label wraps input/select/textarea; label.check wraps a checkbox or radio\n  data: table (styled; td.num for numbers), badge, badge-secondary|badge-outline|badge-destructive, stat-label, stat-value, progress (inner div with style=\"width:NN%\"), avatar\n- Charts: <div data-chart='{\"type\":\"bar|line|area|pie\",\"title\":\"…\",\"data\":[{\"label\":\"W1\",\"value\":120}]}'></div> renders an SVG chart (single series, pie gets a legend). Do not draw charts yourself.\n- Light and dark mode are handled by the stylesheet.\n\nDESIGN BRIEF (applies to every UI you produce):\n- Build a complete, realistic screen, not a skeleton: a clear title and intro, grouped sections, and enough detail that it could ship.\n- Cover exactly what the request names, with no extra pages or marketing sections.\n- Use the supplied DATA in full: every field is there to be shown. Derive useful extras from it (shares, totals, deltas, rankings) instead of inventing unrelated numbers.\n- Where it fits, add status badges, trend/change figures, secondary actions, helper text, and sensible empty or edge-case copy.\n- Establish hierarchy with headings, size and weight; group related items; keep spacing and alignment consistent.\n- Make charts readable: a title, labelled axes or values, and a legend for pie charts.\n- Never use lorem ipsum or placeholder names like \"Item 1\".","systemHash":"0c16911c9564c3db3ada7a622931ee6ffc820ebf9a373996782a9f1f0fc3c98c","systemOverridden":false,"strictOutput":false,"rawOutput":"<h1>Simple, Transparent Pricing</h1>\n<p class=\"lead\">Choose the plan that fits your needs. All paid plans include a 30-day money-back guarantee and free setup support.</p>\n\n<div class=\"row center gap-sm\" style=\"margin: 1.5rem 0;\">\n  <button class=\"btn btn-sm btn-primary\" id=\"monthlyBtn\" onclick=\"toggleBilling('monthly')\">Monthly</button>\n  <button class=\"btn btn-sm btn-outline\" id=\"annualBtn\" onclick=\"toggleBilling('annual')\">Annual</button>\n  <span class=\"badge badge-secondary\" id=\"saveBadge\" style=\"display: none;\">Save up to 20%</span>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"grid cols-3 gap-lg\">\n  <div class=\"card\">\n    <div class=\"card-title\">Free</div>\n    <p class=\"muted\" style=\"margin-bottom: 1rem;\">Perfect for side projects and personal use</p>\n    <div class=\"row center gap-sm\" style=\"margin-bottom: 1.5rem;\">\n      <span class=\"stat-value\" style=\"font-size: 2.5rem;\">$0</span>\n      <span class=\"muted\">/month</span>\n    </div>\n    <ul class=\"stack gap-sm\" style=\"margin-bottom: 1.5rem; padding-left: 0; list-style: none;\">\n      <li class=\"row center gap-sm\"><span class=\"badge badge-secondary\">✓</span> 1 active project</li>\n      <li class=\"row center gap-sm\"><span class=\"badge badge-secondary\">✓</span> 5GB storage</li>\n      <li class=\"row center gap-sm\"><span class=\"badge badge-secondary\">✓</span> Community support</li>\n      <li class=\"row center gap-sm\"><span class=\"badge badge-secondary\">✓</span> Basic analytics</li>\n      <li class=\"row center gap-sm\"><span class=\"badge badge-secondary\">✓</span> Standard integrations</li>\n      <li class=\"row center gap-sm\"><span class=\"muted\">✕</span> Custom domain</li>\n      <li class=\"row center gap-sm\"><span class=\"muted\">✕</span> Priority support</li>\n      <li class=\"row center gap-sm\"><span class=\"muted\">✕</span> Team collaboration</li>\n    </ul>\n    <button class=\"btn btn-secondary btn-block\">Sign Up Free</button>\n    <p class=\"small muted\" style=\"text-align: center; margin-top: 0.75rem;\">No credit card required</p>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"card\" style=\"border: 2px solid var(--primary, #2563eb);\">\n    <div class=\"row between center\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0.5rem;\">\n      <span class=\"card-title\">Pro</span>\n      <span class=\"badge badge-destructive\">Most Popular</span>\n    </div>\n    <p class=\"muted\" style=\"margin-bottom: 1rem;\">For professionals and growing projects</p>\n    <div class=\"row center gap-sm\" style=\"margin-bottom: 1.5rem;\">\n      <span class=\"stat-value\" style=\"font-size: 2.5rem;\" id=\"proPrice\">$19</span>\n      <span class=\"muted\">/month</span>\n    </div>\n    <p class=\"small muted\" id=\"proAnnualNote\" style=\"display: none; margin-bottom: 1rem;\">Billed annually at $180/year</p>\n    <ul class=\"stack gap-sm\" style=\"margin-bottom: 1.5rem; padding-left: 0; list-style: none;\">\n      <li class=\"row center gap-sm\"><span class=\"badge badge-secondary\">✓</span> 10 active projects</li>\n      <li class=\"row center gap-sm\"><span class=\"badge badge-secondary\">✓</span> 50GB storage</li>\n      <li class=\"row center gap-sm\"><span class=\"badge badge-secondary\">✓</span> Priority email support</li>\n      <li class=\"row center gap-sm\"><span class=\"badge badge-secondary\">✓</span> Advanced analytics</li>\n      <li class=\"row center gap-sm\"><span class=\"badge badge-secondary\">✓</span> Custom domain + SSL</li>\n      <li class=\"row center gap-sm\"><span class=\"badge badge-secondary\">✓</span> Ad-free experience</li>\n      <li class=\"row center gap-sm\"><span class=\"badge badge-secondary\">✓</span> Team collaboration (up to 3 users)</li>\n      <li class=\"row center gap-sm\"><span class=\"badge badge-secondary\">✓</span> Full API access</li>\n    </ul>\n    <button class=\"btn btn-primary btn-block\">Start 14-Day Trial</button>\n    <p class=\"small muted\" style=\"text-align: center; margin-top: 0.75rem;\">No credit card required for trial</p>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"card\">\n    <div class=\"card-title\">Team</div>\n    <p class=\"muted\" style=\"margin-bottom: 1rem;\">For teams and businesses that need more power</p>\n    <div class=\"row center gap-sm\" style=\"margin-bottom: 1.5rem;\">\n      <span class=\"stat-value\" style=\"font-size: 2.5rem;\" id=\"teamPrice\">$49</span>\n      <span class=\"muted\">/month</span>\n    </div>\n    <p class=\"small muted\" id=\"teamAnnualNote\" style=\"display: none; margin-bottom: 1rem;\">Billed annually at $468/year</p>\n    <ul class=\"stack gap-sm\" style=\"margin-bottom: 1.5rem; padding-left: 0; list-style: none;\">\n      <li class=\"row center gap-sm\"><span class=\"badge badge-secondary\">✓</span> Unlimited active projects</li>\n      <li class=\"row center gap-sm\"><span class=\"badge badge-secondary\">✓</span> 200GB storage</li>\n      <li class=\"row center gap-sm\"><span class=\"badge badge-secondary\">✓</span> 24/7 dedicated support</li>\n      <li class=\"row center gap-sm\"><span class=\"badge badge-secondary\">✓</span> Enterprise-grade analytics</li>\n      <li class=\"row center gap-sm\"><span class=\"badge badge-secondary\">✓</span> Custom domain + SSL</li>\n      <li class=\"row center gap-sm\"><span class=\"badge badge-secondary\">✓</span> Ad-free experience</li>\n      <li class=\"row center gap-sm\"><span class=\"badge badge-secondary\">✓</span> Unlimited team members</li>\n      <li class=\"row center gap-sm\"><span class=\"badge badge-secondary\">✓</span> Admin controls & SSO</li>\n      <li class=\"row center gap-sm\"><span class=\"badge badge-secondary\">✓</span> Custom integrations</li>\n      <li class=\"row center gap-sm\"><span class=\"badge badge-secondary\">✓</span> Priority feature requests</li>\n    </ul>\n    <button class=\"btn btn-outline btn-block\">Contact Sales</button>\n    <p class=\"small muted\" style=\"text-align: center; margin-top: 0.75rem;\">Custom pricing for enterprise needs</p>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"alert\" style=\"text-align: center; margin-top: 2rem;\">\n  All paid plans come with a <strong>30-day money-back guarantee</strong>. If you're not satisfied, we'll refund you in full, no questions asked.\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"row center gap-sm\" style=\"margin-top: 2rem;\">\n  <p class=\"muted\">Have questions about which plan is right for you?</p>\n  <a href=\"#\" class=\"btn btn-ghost btn-sm\">Talk to our team</a>\n</div>\n\n<script>\nfunction toggleBilling(period) {\n  const monthlyBtn = document.getElementById('monthlyBtn');\n  const annualBtn = document.getElementById('annualBtn');\n  const saveBadge = document.getElementById('saveBadge');\n  const proPrice = document.getElementById('proPrice');\n  const teamPrice = document.getElementById('teamPrice');\n  const proAnnualNote = document.getElementById('proAnnualNote');\n  const teamAnnualNote = document.getElementById('teamAnnualNote');\n\n  if (period === 'monthly') {\n    monthlyBtn.classList.remove('btn-outline');\n    monthlyBtn.classList.add('btn-primary');\n    annualBtn.classList.remove('btn-primary');\n    annualBtn.classList.add('btn-outline');\n    saveBadge.style.display = 'none';\n    proPrice.textContent = '$19';\n    teamPrice.textContent = '$49';\n    proAnnualNote.style.display = 'none';\n    teamAnnualNote.style.display = 'none';\n  } else {\n    annualBtn.classList.remove('btn-outline');\n    annualBtn.classList.add('btn-primary');\n    monthlyBtn.classList.remove('btn-primary');\n    monthlyBtn.classList.add('btn-outline');\n    saveBadge.style.display = 'inline';\n    proPrice.textContent = '$15';\n    teamPrice.textContent = '$39';\n    proAnnualNote.style.display = 'block';\n    teamAnnualNote.style.display = 'block';\n  }\n}\n</script>","deltas":[[31805,"<h1>Simple"],[31806,", Transparent Pricing"],[31843,"</h1>\n"],[31853,"<p class=\"lead"],[31889,"\">Choose the plan"],[31898," that fits your needs"],[31939,". All paid plans"],[31945," include a 30"],[31956,"-day money-back guarantee"],[32000," and free setup"],[32012," support.</p>\n\n"],[32057,"<div class=\"row"],[32097," center gap"],[32115,"-sm\" style=\""],[32136,"margin:"],[32136," 1"],[32185,".5rem "],[32195,"0;\">\n  <"],[32195,"button class=\"btn"],[32233," btn-sm btn-primary"],[32243,"\" id=\"month"],[32279,"lyBtn\" onclick"],[32336,"=\"toggleB"],[32350,"illing('monthly"],[32362,"')\">Monthly</"],[32375,"button>\n  <"],[32388,"button class=\"btn"],[32436," btn-sm btn-out"],[32447,"line\" id=\""],[32485,"annualBtn\" onclick"],[32497,"=\"toggleBilling"],[32532,"('annual')\">"],[32542,"Annual</button>\n"],[32589,"  <span class"],[32598,"=\"badge badge"],[32632,"-secondary\" id=\""],[32642,"saveBadge\""],[32679," style=\"display:"],[32689," none;\">Save up"],[32753," to 20%"],[32768,"</span>\n</"],[32768,"div>\n\n<div class"],[32801,"=\"grid cols"],[32811,"-3 gap-lg"],[32873,"\">\n  <div"],[32884," class=\"card\">\n"],[32915,"    <div class"],[32920,"=\"card-title\">"],[32973,"Free</div>\n"],[32984,"    <p class"],[32997,"=\"muted\""],[33005," style=\"margin-bottom"],[33091,": 1rem"],[33101,";\">Perfect"],[33101," for side projects and"],[33121," personal use</p"],[33127,">\n   